---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import ArtGallery from "../components/ArtGallery.astro";
---

<Layout title="About | Carrie Feng">
  <section class="container" style="padding: 64px 0;">
    <h1 style="margin-bottom: 24px;">About</h1>

    <p style="max-width: 70ch; margin-bottom: 18px;">
      I'm interested in how we communicate big ideas, especially on closing the gap between large data sets and real life. A lot of datasets on topics like environmental, financial records, etc. can seem distant at first so I work on ways to make them concrete.  
    </p>

    <p style="max-width: 70ch; margin-bottom: 18px;">
      I'm also drown to product storytelling. I am curious about how brands build trust and how consumers interpret these messages. It's fascinating to look at the gap between what a company says and what their data actually shows.
    </p>

    <p style="max-width: 70ch; margin-bottom: 36px;">
      Outside of class, I like projects that involve observing the world.
      I enjoy traveling, photography, ceramics, and lately picked up running. I’m
      someone who likes a good balance between structure and experimentation, whether that’s building
      a visualization by hand or sketching out an idea.
    </p>
    <section>
    
    <!-- Art Gallery -->
    <ArtGallery />
  </section>
</Layout>
